{"id":"b732c7d55f62216b","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-incompressible-count.md","title":"Counting Plain Incompressible Strings","display":"thm-incompressible-count — Counting Plain Incompressible Strings","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-incompressible-count","aliases":["43-thm-incompressible-count"],"display":"thm-incompressible-count — Counting Plain Incompressible Strings","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-incompressible]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 6.1.3 and following counting argument","source_printed_pages":"88","source_pdf_pages":"108","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-incompressible-count"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-incompressible-count</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-incompressible-count — Counting Plain Incompressible Strings"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6f984600c044f352\" href=\"?note=6f984600c044f352\" title=\"43-df-incompressible\">43-df-incompressible</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 6.1.3 and following counting argument"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"88"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"108"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le n\">\\(k\\le n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incompressible}\">\\(\\mathrm{Incompressible}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6f984600c044f352\" href=\"?note=6f984600c044f352\" title=\"43-df-incompressible\">43-df-incompressible</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:C(\\sigma)&lt;n-k\\}|\\le2^{n-k}-1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:C(\\sigma)&lt;n-k\\}|\\le2^{n-k}-1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,k)\\}|\\ge2^n-2^{n-k}+1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,k)\\}|\\ge2^n-2^{n-k}+1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n\\;C(\\sigma)\\ge n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n\\;C(\\sigma)\\ge n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>长度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-k\">\\(n-k\\)</span> 的二进制程序总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n-k}-1\">\\(2^{n-k}-1\\)</span>；每个程序至多描述一个输出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=n\">\\(k=n\\)</span> 时短程序集合为空，也满足该式。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 6.1.3 and following counting argument；印刷页 88，PDF 页 108。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-incompressible","status":"resolved","id":"6f984600c044f352","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-incompressible]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\le n$；$C$ 与 $\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-incompressible]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-incompressible","status":"resolved","id":"6f984600c044f352","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\le n$；$C$ 与 $\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-incompressible]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incompressible}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:C(\\sigma)<n-k\\}|\\le2^{n-k}-1,","display":true},{"tex":"|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,k)\\}|\\ge2^n-2^{n-k}+1,","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n\\;C(\\sigma)\\ge n.","display":true},{"tex":"n-k","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n-k}-1","display":false},{"tex":"k=n","display":false}],"bytes":1444,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-incompressible-count]] — Counting Plain Incompressible Strings"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","6f984600c044f352"]}